# Unity serializes empty YAML fields as "key: " with a trailing space and rewrites it on every project open,
# so .meta files are not normalized. Exempt only the trailing-space check, and only for .meta files, across
# the whole DoorPrototype content tree -- this recurs on every new asset family Unity touches (2026-09-17:
# 284 files under Wizard/Source/PixelLab128 alone; 2026-09-22: 100+ more across Doors/Enemies/Environment/
# Spells, none of them content the fix should have to keep re-scoping file-by-file).
Assets/NoSafeCircle/DoorPrototype/**/*.meta whitespace=-blank-at-eol
